# Local reverse-engineering reference (decompiled app + web frontend dumps).
# Kept locally for analysis only; never publish or commit. The " - 新" variant is the
# current local copy — without this line `git add -A` tries to stage it (and chokes on
# Windows MAX_PATH for deep smali paths), so exclude it explicitly too.
APP和網頁前端/
APP和網頁前端 - 新/
# Consolidated 2026-07 RE work (fresh crawl + APK/IPA/web decompile). Contains wild QR
# tokens, hardcoded vendor keys, decompiled sources — never commit. Off-repo by convention.
Tronclass 逆向/
# Local backup of this project's Claude memory (research notes + test-account refs) — never commit.
Claude Memory/

